Delete a specified autoscaling group and all its associated
resources.

USAGE:
  scw autoscaling group delete [arg=value ...]

EXAMPLES:
  Delete a specified autoscaling group
    scw autoscaling group delete group-id=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

ARGS:
  group-id          ID of the group to delete
  [zone=fr-par-1]   Zone to target. If none is passed will use default zone from the config (fr-par-1 | fr-par-2 | fr-par-3)

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for delete
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use
